        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this charming 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom terraced home to the market, ideally positioned at No. 8 Palmers Court, Palmerstown, Dublin 20.\r\nPalmers Court is a mature and highly sought-after residential development, renowned for its peaceful setting, excellent convenience, and strong sense of community. Situated in the heart of Palmerstown, residents benefit from an abundance of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés, parks, and sporting facilities all within easy reach. The Phoenix Park, Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, and Chapelizod Village are all located nearby, while Dublin City Centre is easily accessible via an excellent public transport network. The N4 and M50 road networks are also just moments away, making this an ideal location for commuters.\r\nNo. 8 Palmers Court comes to the market in good condition throughout and offers a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, and investors alike to acquire a home in one of Dublin 20's most desirable residential areas.\r\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation extends to approximately 80 sqm and briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious living room, and a fully fitted kitchen/dining area on the ground floor. Upstairs boasts two generous bedrooms and a main family bathroom. The property further benefits from a private rear garden, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing.\r\nThis attractive home combines comfortable living accommodation with an unbeatable location and is sure to generate significant interest. Early viewing is highly advised—contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information or to arrange a viewing.\r\nFeatures\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>2 bed / 1 bath terraced home</li>\r\n <li>BER C</li>\r\n <li>c.80 sqm of internal floorspace</li>\r\n <li>Presented in great condition throughout</li>\r\n <li>Bright and well-proportioned accommodation</li>\r\n <li>Private rear garden</li>\r\n <li> Mature and highly sought-after residential estate</li>\r\n <li> Excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, and investors</li>\r\n <li>Peaceful cul-de-sac setting</li>\r\n <li>Excellent transport links including bus routes, N4 & M50</li>\r\n <li>Close to schools, shops, parks and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre</li>\r\n <li>Within easy reach of Phoenix Park and Dublin City Centre</li>\r\n <li> Highly desirable Palmerstown location</li>\r\n <li>Early viewing strongly advised</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nDirections:\r\nD20 FA09"
      },
      {
